{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈子だよー٩(◦`꒳´◦)۶♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日ね、朝早かったんだけど\n家に帰ってきて\n夕方過ぎから今の今まで寝ちゃってて\n妹に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹「お姉ちゃんブログ書いたー？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私「んー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹「おー！よかった！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私「zzz。。。」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹「ん？  ねー？ほんとに書いたー？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私「んーーーーー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「(｡ρω-｡)」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「はっっっっっっっ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「(´⊙ω⊙`)」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、なり飛び起きたところでございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夕方過ぎに\nおかしなガムボールを見ながら\nうとうとしてきてる日奈子をお母さんがみて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母「このあと寝ちゃうんじゃない～？\n先にブログ書いたらー？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私「大丈夫～！寝ないから！平気！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3分後............"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私「(｡ρω-｡)zzzzzz」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です。ごめんなさい。ほんとに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでね、なにが言いたいかというと\nコメントは見たんだけど\nヒナコセレクト(仮)と冒頭あいさつと終わりのあいさつをまとめきれてないので\nこんなブログになってしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(´；д；｀)ごめんなさい～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかもね、夜ご飯を満腹感を200%こせるとこまで食べて、すぐに寝たから\nなんか胃もたれしてるしね～\n食べてすぐ寝たら太るのにね～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー。。。しくじったよー。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カナシイタケ。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/19/1527280/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/19/1527280/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/01/19/1527280/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日のブログのヒナコセレクト(仮)と\n冒頭あいさつと終わりのあいさつは\n昨日のブログと今日のブログの\nコメントから選びます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飛び起きたから目が覚めちゃった(´；д；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、もうみんな寝る時間。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サミシイタケ。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさいっ(ノ_・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝るの？みなさん(｡-_-｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう寝ちゃいますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん(ノ_・。)。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント読みながら寝落ちれたら幸せだな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい(ノ_・。)"}],"source":"archive"}